OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FVariable
OL,6,Fcloud across the region with the odd
OL,7,Fshower through the evening. Potential
OL,8,Ffor a few cloud breaks in the north
OL,9,Fbut turning overcast in the south with
OL,10,Fmore widespread light rain by dawn.
OL,11,FLight winds. Chilly in clearer spells.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA cloudy start with areas
OL,14,Fof light rain through the morning.
OL,15,FCloud breaks and turning dry for most
OL,16,Fthrough the afternoon. Breezy
OL,17,Fparticularly around the coast with
OL,18,Fnear average temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
